# One player, a single race (gRace 0) on track 0 (docs/port/SYNTH.md 2).
# until: 0x400000:300
# seconds: 75
# expect: state=0x00400000: players 1, windows 1, cars 6, mode 0, track 0
# realtime
5 A            # the controller pak warning (0x40000000)
8 START        # the start prompt (4)
11 A           # the main menu (0x10): the race
14 A           # the player screen (0x20)
17 A           # the mode screen (0x40): the first mode, a single race
20 A           # the track select (0x80): track 0
23 A           # the car select (0x100); then the race start (0x40000), PrePlay (0x80000) and the race (0x400000)
